Take control of your finances with CFPS. Send money within Europe (SEPA) and abroad (SWIFT), spend globally and online securely with a virtual card — all in one place. Drive your finances with CFPS.

APP BENEFITS
- QUICK REGISTRATION and opening a free IBAN account in a minute, right in your smartphone, without lines or leaving home. Free top up EUR account;
- FREE virtual card: no monthly or hidden fees for payments;
- REAL TIME balance checking and transaction history;
- LOW FEES for cash withdrawal and SEPA/SWIFT transfer to any European bank or abroad.


APP FUNCTIONALITY
On the dashboard you can find a short description and the main functionality of the app:
- BALANCE: top up your main account or make transfers;
- CARD WIDGET: check the information and the balance of your cards or manage them in the Card Management section;
- TRANSACTION HISTORY: you can keep track of last purchases, transfers and deposits;
- PAYMENTS: Send money within Europe and internationally.

SOON IN THE APP
Soon you will be able to apply for a physical debit MasterCard card with original design. All new clients will get a physical debit one with cashback (absolutely free for all purchases).

CARD MANAGEMENT
You can turn to the Card Management section through widget cards on the main app screen. Here you can: see your balance, bank details and transaction history, change a pin, top up an account, make a transfer, block or unblock a card.

PAYMENTS
You can turn to the Payments section through the main app screen. To send a payment you need to choose a payment type and a bill or card (where a payment will be sent from), insert a bill and a sum of money to transfer and tap "Send money".

CFPS FEATURES
 - A FINANCIAL CONTROL: save, distribute your finances between accounts and manage your money;
 - SUPPORT SERVICE: ask any questions about the app.
